lied here; a rename would be an Atlas catalog action, not a change in this\nrepository.\n","status":"proposed","title":"ADR 0003 — Crate prefix ekr- (D3)"},"entity_type":"aep.architecture-decision-record/v1","locator":"ep://planning/store/architecture-decision-record/0003-crate-prefix-ekr"},"payload":{"actor":"agent:claude","at":1789955157536,"causation":"cmd-new-architecture-decision-record-0003-crate-prefix-ekr","change":{"change":"created","status":"proposed"},"correlation":"protocol-artifact-new","event_id":"architecture-decision-record:0003-crate-prefix-ekr@1#0~9c930099669cc5b7","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-21T01:45:57Z"}}